== tree /etc/systemd/network
D .
F ./br0.netdev: [NetDev]|Name=br0|Kind=bridge|
F ./br0.network: [Match]|Name=br0||[Network]|Address=192.168.1.20/24|Address=10.0.36.254/24|DHCP=yes|
F ./dummy0.netdev: [NetDev]|Name=dummy0|Kind=dummy|
F ./dummy0.network: [Match]|Name=dummy0||[Network]|Bridge=br0|
F ./eth0.network: [Match]|Name=eth0||[Network]|Bridge=br0|
F ./eth1.network: [Match]|Name=eth1||[Network]|Bridge=br0|
F ./usb0.network: [Match]|Name=usb0||[Network]|Bridge=br0|
